{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746813633853653032","content":"we as DMs also need to try to be good about not falling into cliques of players too.  Its far to easy to only want to interact with your favorite players, and on some level, it adds to all these problems.","created_at":"2020-08-25T23:55:15.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747967362598174760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
